add('creative-director','ALEX / MORGAN',7,'Portfolio','Work that makes you feel something.',
    ['#210706','#fff0dd','#ff9e64','#34110d'],
    '<section class="hero editorial"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">ALEX MORGAN / EXECUTIVE CREATIVE DIRECTOR</div><h1>Good work<br>doesn’t whisper.<br><span class="serif">It stays.</span></h1><div class="editorial-bottom"><p class="lead">Independent thinking.<br>Unreasonable attention to detail.<br>A healthy disregard for ordinary.</p>'+actions('The work','#experience','The thinking','#details')+'</div></div>'+stage('MOLTEN / FIELD STUDY')+'</section>'
    +section('experience',heading('01—08 / SELECTED WORK','A few things<br>I <span class="serif">believe in.</span>')+'<div class="case-list">'+''.join(f'<button class="case-row" data-case="{name}"><span class="mono">0{i+1}</span><strong>{name}</strong><span class="case-type">{tag}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>' for i,(name,tag) in enumerate([('Ordinary People','Brand strategy'),('Not Another Tomorrow','Campaign'),('A Good Kind of Noise','Art direction'),('Off Script','Digital experience'),('Second Nature','Identity system'),('The Long Way Home','Film concept'),('Against the Grain','Editorial'),('All Together Now','Creative platform')]))+'</div>')
    +section('details','<div class="split"><div><div class="eyebrow">THE THINKING</div><h2 class="serif">“Make it mean<br>something.<br>Then make it<br>impossible to ignore.”</h2></div><div><p class="lead">Ideas are easy to admire. The work is making them matter. I connect strategy, design, and storytelling to build things with a point of view.</p>'+steps([('Find the truth','Start with a human observation, not a visual trend.'),('Choose a direction','Be specific enough to be interesting. Brave enough to be different.'),('Make it real','Bring the same care to the last pixel as the first conversation.')])+'</div></div>')
    +section('recognition',heading('SELECTED PRINCIPLES','No borrowed trophies.','This is a fictional portfolio. The work, person, and briefs are invented; no real awards or clients are claimed.')+cards([('01','Human before clever.','Create something that connects before something that impresses.'),('02','Restraint is a choice.','Leave room for the audience to finish the thought.'),('03','Make every detail earn it.','Nothing is decoration when everything has a purpose.')]))+cta('Got a feeling?<br><span class="serif">Let’s follow it.</span>'),
    ':root{--radius:0}.editorial{display:block;min-height:740px;isolation:isolate}.editorial .hero-copy{padding-top:20px}.editorial h1{font-size:clamp(65px,8.4vw,130px);line-height:.96}.editorial .stage{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:-1;opacity:.8}.editorial .stage-tag,.editorial .stage-corner{display:none}.editorial-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-top:50px}.case-row{width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:50px 1fr 170px 30px;text-align:left;align-items:center;background:none;border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:25px 0;color:var(--fg);gap:20px}.case-row strong{font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-1px;font-weight:400}.case-row:hover{color:var(--accent);padding-left:10px}.case-type{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:680px){.editorial h1{font-size:14vw}.editorial-bottom{display:block}.case-row{grid-template-columns:25px 1fr 20px;gap:10px}.case-type{display:none}.case-row strong{font-size:22px}.editorial{min-height:670px}}',
    'A full-plane GLSL domain-warped sine/noise field blends deep crimson, red, and orange with subtle grain. Pointer position warps the field; selected case rows update the hue target. Eight keyboard-operable case-study dialogs replace hover-only content.',
    'Alex Morgan and every project are fictional. No Cannes/D&AD/Awwwards claims are reproduced. Contact uses a local inquiry demonstration rather than a real personal email. Shader approximates molten fluid without a physical fluid simulation.',
    ['Open all eight case rows by keyboard','Inspect pointer deformation and focus alternatives','Verify no invented award claims or misleading email delivery'])

